{"suttaId":"thag16.7","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[3280,3335],"vripara":"842"},"segments":{"thag16.7:0.4":"Kāḷigodhāputtabhaddiyattheragāthā","thag16.7:1.1":"“Yātaṃ me hatthigīvāya, sukhumā vatthā padhāritā;","thag16.7:1.3":"Sālīnaṃ odano bhutto, sucimaṃsūpasecano.","thag16.7:2.1":"“Sojja bhaddo sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;","thag16.7:2.3":"Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:3.1":"“Paṃsukūlī sātatiko, uñchāpattāgate rato;","thag16.7:3.3":"Jhāyati anupādāno, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:4.1":"“Piṇḍapātī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:5.1":"“Tecīvarī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:6.1":"“Sapadānacārī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:7.1":"“Ekāsanī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:7.3":"“Pattapiṇḍī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:9.1":"“Khalupacchābhattī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:10.1":"“Āraññiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:11.1":"“Rukkhamūliko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:12.1":"“Abbhokāsī sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:13.1":"“Sosāniko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:14.1":"“Yathāsanthatiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:15.1":"“Nesajjiko sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:16.1":"“Appiccho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:17.1":"“Santuṭṭho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:17.3":"“Pavivitto sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:19.1":"“Asaṃsaṭṭho sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:20.1":"“Āraddhavīriyo sātatiko … pe ….","thag16.7:21.1":"“Hitvā satapalaṃ kaṃsaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ satarājikaṃ;","thag16.7:21.3":"Aggahiṃ mattikāpattaṃ, idaṃ dutiyābhisecanaṃ.","thag16.7:22.1":"“Ucce maṇḍalipākāre, daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhake;","thag16.7:22.3":"Rakkhito khaggahatthehi, uttasaṃ vihariṃ pure.","thag16.7:23.1":"“Sojja bhaddo anutrāsī, pahīnabhayabheravo;","thag16.7:23.3":"Jhāyati vanamogayha, putto godhāya bhaddiyo.","thag16.7:24.1":"“Sīlakkhandhe patiṭṭhāya, satiṃ paññañca bhāvayaṃ;","thag16.7:24.3":"Pāpuṇiṃ anupubbena, sabbasaṃyojanakkhayan”ti.","thag16.7:24.5":"… Bhaddiyo kāḷigodhāya putto thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-ii","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a2.att","from":3987,"to":3990,"paras":[{"para":3987,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag16.7:24"],"lines":["Tattha <b>yātaṃ me hatthigīvāyā</b>ti, bhante, pubbe mayā gacchantenāpi hatthigīvāya hatthikkhandhe nisīditvā yātaṃ caritaṃ.","Vatthāni pariharantenāpi <b>sukhumā</b> sukhasamphassā kāsikavatthavisesā dhāritā.","Odanaṃ bhuñjantenāpi tivassikānaṃ purāṇagandhasālīnaṃ odano tittirakapiñjarādinā sucinā maṃsena upasittatāya <b>sucimaṃsūpasecano</b> bhutto, tathāpi taṃ sukhaṃ na mayhaṃ cittaparitosakaraṃ ahosi, yathā etarahi vivekasukhanti dassento āha <b>“sojja bhaddo”</b>tiādi.","Ettha ca hatthiggahaṇeneva assarathayānāni, vatthaggahaṇena sabbarājālaṅkārā, odanaggahaṇena sabbabhojanavikati gahitāti veditabbaṃ.","<b>Sojjā</b>ti so ajja etarahi pabbajjāyaṃ ṭhito.","<b>Bhaddo</b>ti sīlādiguṇehi samannāgatattā bhaddo.","<b>Sātatiko</b>ti samaṇadhamme diṭṭhadhammasukhavihāre sātaccayutto.","<b>Uñchāpattāgate rato</b>ti uñchācariyāya patte āgate pattapariyāpanne abhirato, teneva santuṭṭhoti adhippāyo.","<b>Jhāyatī</b>ti phalasamāpattijhānena jhāyati.","<b>Putto godhāyā</b>ti kāḷigodhāya nāma khattiyāya putto.","<b>Bhaddiyo</b>ti evaṃnāmo attānameva thero aññaṃ viya katvā vadati."],"lineRefs":[["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"]]},{"para":3988,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Gahapaticīvaraṃ paṭikkhipitvā paṃsukūlikaṅgasamādānena <b>paṃsukūliko</b>.","Saṅghabhattaṃ paṭikkhipitvā piṇḍapātikaṅgasamādānena <b>piṇḍapātiko</b>.","Atirekacīvaraṃ paṭikkhipitvā tecīvarikaṅgasamādānena <b>tecīvariko</b>.","Loluppacāraṃ paṭikkhipitvā sapadānacārikaṅgasamādānena <b>sapadānacārī</b>.","Nānāsanabhojanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā ekāsanikaṅgasamādānena <b>ekāsaniko</b>.","Dutiyakabhājanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā pattapiṇḍikaṅgasamādānena <b>pattapiṇḍiko</b>.","Atirittabhojanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā khalupacchābhattikaṅgasamādānena <b>khalupacchābhattiko</b>.","Gāmantasenāsanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā āraññikaṅgasamādānena <b>āraññiko</b>.","Channavāsaṃ paṭikkhipitvā rukkhamūlikaṅgasamādānena <b>rukkhamūliko</b>.","Channarukkhamūlāni paṭikkhipitvā abbhokāsikaṅgasamādānena <b>abbhokāsiko</b>.","Nasusānaṃ paṭikkhipitvā sosānikaṅgasamādānena <b>sosāniko</b>.","Senāsanaloluppaṃ paṭikkhipitvā yathāsanthatikaṅgasamādānena <b>yathāsanthatiko</b>.","Sayanaṃ paṭikkhipitvā nesajjikaṅgasamādānena <b>nesajjiko</b>.","Ayamettha saṅkhepo.","Vitthārato pana dhutaṅgakathā <b>visuddhimagge</b> (visuddhi.1.22 ādayo) vuttanayeneva gahetabbā."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":3989,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Ucce</b>ti uccādiṭṭhāne, uparipāsādatāya vā ucce.","<b>Maṇḍalipākāre</b>ti maṇḍalākārena pākāraparikkhitte.","<b>Daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhake</b>ti thirehi aṭṭālehi dvārakoṭṭhakehi ca samannāgate, nagareti attho."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[]]},{"para":3990,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag16.7:24"],"lines":["<b>Satiṃ paññañcā</b>ti ettha satisīsena samādhiṃ vadati.","Phalasamāpattinirodhasamāpattiyo sandhāya “satiṃ paññañca bhāvayan”ti vutto.","Sesaṃ tattha tattha vuttanayattā uttānameva."],"lineRefs":[["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"],["thag16.7:24"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag16.7:24.5","bhaddo",0,5],["thag16.7:24.5","bhaddiyo",0,10],["thag16.7:24.1","satiṃ paññañcā",3,0]]},"tika":null}
